	<div class="wrapper">
		<div class="standardPage border-bottom">
			<div class="pageContent eventPageContent no-border full">
								<h2 class="navy">About the Event</h2>
		<p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>2024 ABFAA State Field Tournament</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>DATE: November 9, 2024</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>WHERE: Tucson Mountain Park Archery Range -  Kinney Road, Tucson, AZ</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span> 14 Field targets, 14 Hunter targets</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>Awards ceremony following completion of the competition.</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>NFAA rules apply.</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>SHOOTERS meeting and START times.</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>Saturday November 9th, 2024</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>Check-in 7:30 am to 8:30 am - Shooters meeting  8:45 am - Shotgun Start - 9:00 am</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>There will be a 6-hour time limit!</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>AWARDS 3:30 PM</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>SNACKS AND DRINKS WILL BE SOLD AT THE EVENT. Water on the course as designated locations.</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>AGE Division on the date of the tournament</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Cub 11 &amp; under ($35)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Youth 12 - 14  ($40)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Young Adults 15 - 17  ($40)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Adults 18 - 49  ($50)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Senior 50 - 59  ($50)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Silver Senior 60 - 69  ($50)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Master Senior 70 + ($40)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Pro Division - Adult, Senior, Silver Senior &amp; Master Senior Cost is $100 </p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">50% payback (must possess a current NFAA Pro Card in good standing to compete. Professional Divisions are Freestyle only)</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><span>Classes Per NFAA rules:</span></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Freestyle- Freestyle Limited - Bowhunter Freestyle  - Freestyle Limited Recurve - Barebow (compound) - Barebow Recurve - Longbow </p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">An exception to NFAA Rules for Arizona State tournaments only:</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Traditional - Longbow,  - will shoot from the cub stakes at a maximum of 30 yards. </p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Barebow recure will shoot max 50 yards</p> <p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Competition Rules:</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><a href="http://abfaa.info/wp/basics-of-field-archery/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">http://abfaa.info/wp/basics-of-field-archery/</a></p> <p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">VIDEOS</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">NFAA Fundamentals of a Field Round</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNBzWnNvMdE" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNBzWnNvMdE</a></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">NFAA Fundamentals of a Hunter Round</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VbeLpCZjx6s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VbeLpCZjx6s</a></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">Fundamentals of an Animal Round</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFJ84eKtgl4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFJ84eKtgl4</a></p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">QUESTIONS: Call Caytie Belzner  480 620 4644</p><p style="margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;color:rgb(0,112,141);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(218,243,250);">email:   <a href="mailto:caytiebel